      "en": "The light will be dark in his tent. His lamp above him will be put out.",
      "ko": "그 장막 안의 빛은 어두워지고 그 위의 등불은 꺼질 것이요",
      "source_text_hash": "b9bb570ce884846577658e2f97cb2dab597ecc949c795abc2292e240f4b2fa4f",
      "translation_text_hash": "9151aebf04c04fb531475179c54749ae931e29f1776a2f174029aad70a74c8ae",
