      "en": "A snare will take him by the heel. A trap will catch him.",
      "ko": "그 발뒤꿈치는 창애에 치이고 그 몸은 올무에 얽힐 것이며",
      "source_text_hash": "ab8f5b48c770a16cc8b5c1aae15a9fbc2898169abe738de9ef78d26960b14987",
      "translation_text_hash": "2231dfcf21043e79589830e3bec8d9adea0f4d4dd7ad32d1065d90681dce87f8",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
